    "## Learning Objectives\n",
    "# Project 07: Burrows-Wheeler Transform\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook implements the Burrows-Wheeler Transform (BWT), suffix arrays,\n",
    "FM-index backward search, and run-length encoding. The implementation uses\n",
    "uppercase text and `$` as a unique end-of-string sentinel.\n",
    "\n",
    "The occurrence table uses **inclusive indexing**: `occur[c][i]` is the number\n",
    "of occurrences of `c` in `bwt[:i + 1]`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "e27abfaccd7c81b0",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
